WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.306 --> 00:00:02.022
- My mom worked nine to six at the bank

00:00:02.022 --> 00:00:04.599
and my dad worked three
to 12 at the shipyard.

00:00:04.599 --> 00:00:06.109
It was all for us kids,

00:00:06.109 --> 00:00:08.506
they just worked so hard to make us happy.

00:00:08.506 --> 00:00:09.339
Ay.

00:00:09.339 --> 00:00:10.172
- Ay.

00:00:10.172 --> 00:00:11.005
- Ay.

00:00:11.005 --> 00:00:15.172
That's what I want for my
daughters, just to be happy.

00:00:17.864 --> 00:00:20.143
Alright, they don't have any
toddler-sized Moana costumes

00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:24.376
so I'm gonna try and make one
of my own for my daughter.

00:00:24.376 --> 00:00:27.188
(Wife and daughter laugh)

00:00:27.188 --> 00:00:28.220
She's big into Moana.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:32.387
The other night she even
woke up asking for Moana.

00:00:38.472 --> 00:00:42.481
I've got an old shirt, some
fabric that I bought off of eBay

00:00:42.481 --> 00:00:45.398
and I got some Velcro just in case.

00:00:52.215 --> 00:00:54.892
But this is just a kids costume,
she won't even remember it.

00:00:54.892 --> 00:00:56.519
My wife Kate doesn't think I can do it,

00:00:56.519 --> 00:00:58.726
I'm gonna prove her wrong.

00:00:58.726 --> 00:01:01.015
(upbeat music)

00:01:01.015 --> 00:01:02.041
Flynn is sleeping, so obviously

00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:04.787
I can't put these clothes
on her, that'd be weird

00:01:04.787 --> 00:01:06.594
and would wake her up and she'd be grumpy.

00:01:06.594 --> 00:01:09.343
So I'm gonna use my teddy bear Gumdy

00:01:09.343 --> 00:01:10.831
who I've had since I was five.

00:01:10.831 --> 00:01:12.655
He's roughly the size of Flynn.

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:15.157
It'll just give me an idea
of how it'll look on her.

00:01:15.157 --> 00:01:16.919
Gumdy won't be embarrassed, I'm sure.

00:01:16.919 --> 00:01:20.822
So Moana's dress is
strapless but that's probably

00:01:20.822 --> 00:01:22.800
not gonna work for a toddler,
so I'm just gonna use

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:26.664
this drawstring that I pulled
from an old BuzzFeed hoodie.

00:01:26.664 --> 00:01:27.833
Kate doesn't think this is gonna work,

00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:29.685
I think it's coming together.

00:01:29.685 --> 00:01:30.602
Who's that?

00:01:32.183 --> 00:01:34.072
What are you doing?

00:01:34.072 --> 00:01:35.289
You hit your head.

00:01:35.289 --> 00:01:36.300
You okay?

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.485
- Moana.

00:01:37.485 --> 00:01:40.152
- You're wearing a Moana outfit.

00:01:48.901 --> 00:01:51.314
- It's Sunday, I went to
the fabric store and got

00:01:51.314 --> 00:01:53.087
more things to make the
costume look a little better.

00:01:53.087 --> 00:01:54.756
I got some ribbon for the top,

00:01:54.756 --> 00:01:56.992
I got some new fabric for the skirt,

00:01:56.992 --> 00:02:00.094
and I got some buttons to make
putting on the top easier.

00:02:00.094 --> 00:02:01.929
Making this Halloween
costume for my daughter

00:02:01.929 --> 00:02:05.137
makes me remember how my
parents made Halloween costumes

00:02:05.137 --> 00:02:06.242
for me when I was a kid.

00:02:06.242 --> 00:02:08.716
I remember when I was
eight, my mom helped me

00:02:08.716 --> 00:02:10.191
make a Dick Tracy costume.

00:02:10.191 --> 00:02:12.241
We made the hat out of posterboard.

00:02:12.241 --> 00:02:15.232
When I was 15 my dad made me Jedi robes.

00:02:15.232 --> 00:02:16.950
My mom worked nine to six at the bank

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.984
and my dad worked three to
12 midnight at the shipyard.

00:02:19.984 --> 00:02:22.712
For them to take out that
time means so much more now

00:02:22.712 --> 00:02:23.811
than I understand.

00:02:23.811 --> 00:02:25.478
They did their best.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.894
They did their best to make me happy.

00:02:32.894 --> 00:02:35.610
It was all for us kids,
there were five of us.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.013
They just worked so hard to make us happy.

00:02:38.013 --> 00:02:39.700
That's what I want for my daughter,

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:42.868
I just hope it makes her happy.

00:02:42.868 --> 00:02:44.830
- [Jared] Say hi, can you see me?

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:45.830
Say hi Lola.

00:02:47.312 --> 00:02:49.747
Doing the things for my
daughter that they did for me

00:02:49.747 --> 00:02:52.462
makes me realize how
much my parents loved me.

00:02:52.462 --> 00:02:55.209
And like I knew they loved
me, but I didn't understand

00:02:55.209 --> 00:02:57.324
how deep that love was.

00:02:57.324 --> 00:02:58.559
- [Jared] Say bye bye!

00:02:58.559 --> 00:02:59.482
- Bye bye.

00:02:59.482 --> 00:03:00.636
- [Man] Love you mom!

00:03:00.636 --> 00:03:01.469
- Love you.

00:03:01.469 --> 00:03:02.886
- You like Moana?

00:03:04.479 --> 00:03:06.770
(laughs) what kind of smile was that?

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:08.259
I think I did pretty good, huh?

00:03:08.259 --> 00:03:09.657
- [Wife] Mhm, A plus.

00:03:09.657 --> 00:03:10.553
- A plus?

00:03:10.553 --> 00:03:12.679
An A plus, very good.

00:03:12.679 --> 00:03:15.262
(upbeat music)

